{
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "autoloader-generic",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "The app ships no composer/autoload.php, so the server registers its generic loader for lib/ and looks every class up in the file system.",
        "  A composer/composer.json with config.vendor-dir \".\", config.optimize-autoloader true, a config.autoloader-suffix and autoload.psr-4 {\"OCA\\\\LogCleaner\\\\\": \"../lib/\"} makes composer dump-autoload write composer/autoload.php with a class map; the code of the app does not change."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "private-api",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [
        "lib/AppInfo/Application.php:86 OC",
        "lib/Controller/Helper.php:83 OC_User"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "2 uses of the private API of the server in 2 files. Only OCP and NCU are public: what is below OC changes without notice between majors.",
        "  lib/AppInfo/Application.php:86 OC",
        "  lib/Controller/Helper.php:83 OC_User"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ocp-missing",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [
        "lib/Controller/SettingsController.php:122 OCP\\IAppConfig::getValue(): Nextcloud 13 is the last major to have it, the app declares up to 35; use method getAppValue of \\OCP\\IConfig  This function gets a value from the appconfig table. If the key does not exist the default value will be returned"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "1 use in 1 file of the public API that a major of Nextcloud 32 to 35 no longer has. The app fails there where it comes to that line, or the server no longer calls the method it overrides.",
        "  lib/Controller/SettingsController.php:122 OCP\\IAppConfig::getValue(): Nextcloud 13 is the last major to have it, the app declares up to 35; use method getAppValue of \\OCP\\IConfig  This function gets a value from the appconfig table. If the key does not exist the default value will be returned"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "boot-listener",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [
        "lib/AppInfo/Application.php:108 get()",
        "lib/AppInfo/Application.php:109 get()",
        "lib/AppInfo/Application.php:118 injectFn()"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "boot() registers a listener or takes a service from the container in 3 places. boot() runs once for every process of the server, so each of them is built on every request. registerEventListener() in register() builds a listener only when its event fires.",
        "  lib/AppInfo/Application.php:108 get()",
        "  lib/AppInfo/Application.php:109 get()",
        "  lib/AppInfo/Application.php:118 injectFn()"
      ]
    },
